{
  "borough": "Hackney",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Approved",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "<p>The development hereby permitted must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date of this permission.</p><p><br></p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\nREASON: In order to comply with the provisions of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).</p><p>\r\n</p>",
    "<p>The Development hereby permitted shall only be carried out and completed strictly in accordance with the submitted plans hereby approved and any subsequent approval of details.\r\n</p><p><br></p><p>\r\nREASON: To ensure that the development hereby permitted is carried out in full accordance with the plans hereby approved.\r\n</p>",
    "&lt;p data-start=&quot;1080&quot; data-end=&quot;1566&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-start=&quot;1080&quot; data-end=&quot;1566&quot;&gt;Prior to the installation of the air source heat pump, a noise assessment of the proposed plant and any associated ancillary equipment shall be carried out by a suitably qualified (IOA accredited) acoustic consultant in accordance with BS4142:2014+A1:2019. The assessment shall demonstrate that the rating level of the plant, including all mitigation, will be at least 10dB below the existing background noise level when measured 1m external from the nearest noise-sensitive premises.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify; &quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1568&quot; data-end=&quot;1894&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-start=&quot;1568&quot; data-end=&quot;1894&quot;&gt;The assessment, together with full details of any necessary mitigation measures, shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority prior to the installation of the air source heat pump. The plant shall thereafter be installed, operated and maintained in full accordance with the approved details.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify; &quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-3dfb52c9-7fff-096e-a52f-6b37868494bb&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;Reason: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;To protect the amenities of adjoining occupiers and the surrounding area.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
